            content: "<div class=\"space-y-5 text-gray-800 leading-relaxed\">\n<h3 class=\"text-base font-black text-gray-950 leading-snug pt-3 border-l-4 border-amber-400 pl-3\">Matriks Pemetaan Jalur Prestasi PTN Terkemuka</h3>\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs min-w-[520px]\"><thead class=\"bg-amber-50\"><tr><th class=\"px-3 py-2.5 align-bottom font-black text-amber-950 border-b border-amber-200\"><b>Nama Institusi</b></th><th class=\"px-3 py-2.5 align-bottom font-black text-amber-950 border-b border-amber-200\"><b>Nama Skema Seleksi</b></th><th class=\"px-3 py-2.5 align-bottom font-black text-amber-950 border-b border-amber-200\"><b>Bidang Prestasi yang Diakomodasi</b></th><th class=\"px-3 py-2.5 align-bottom font-black text-amber-950 border-b border-amber-200\"><b>Karakteristik Utama</b></th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-gray-100\"><tr class=\"even:bg-gray-50/60\"><td class=\"px-3 py-2.5 align-top leading-relaxed font-bold text-gray-900\">Universitas Indonesia (UI)</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2.5 align-top leading-relaxed text-gray-700\">Seleksi Jalur Prestasi (SJP)</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2.5 align-top leading-relaxed text-gray-700\">IPTEKS, Seni, Olahraga</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2.5 align-top leading-relaxed text-gray-700\">Pendaftaran mandiri siswa; minimal Juara 3 Nasional; opsi wawancara MMI fakultatif.</td></tr><tr class=\"even:bg-gray-50/60\"><td class=\"px-3 py-2.5 align-top leading-relaxed font-bold text-gray-900\">Universitas Gadjah Mada (UGM)</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2.5 align-top leading-relaxed text-gray-700\">PBUB (Bibit Unggul Berprestasi)</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2.5 align-top leading-relaxed text-gray-700\">Sains, Olahraga, Seni, Keagamaan</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2.5 align-top leading-relaxed text-gray-700\">Membagi klaster prestasi ke dalam klaster IPTEK dan non-akademik; portofolio terverifikasi.</td></tr><tr class=\"even:bg-gray-50/60\"><td class=\"px-3 py-2.5 align-top leading-relaxed font-bold text-gray-900\">IPB University</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2.5 align-top leading-relaxed text-gray-700\">Talenta IPB &amp; Jalur Ketua OSIS</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2.5 align-top leading-relaxed text-gray-700\">Kejuaraan IPTEK, Kepemimpinan Siswa</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2.5 align-top leading-relaxed text-gray-700\">Menilai kepemimpinan manajerial riil OSIS serta talenta riset inovasi pangan/biosains.</td></tr><tr class=\"even:bg-gray-50/60\"><td class=\"px-3 py-2.5 align-top leading-relaxed font-bold text-gray-900\">Institut Teknologi Bandung (ITB)</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2.5 align-top leading-relaxed text-gray-700\">Seleksi Siswa Unggul</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2.5 align-top leading-relaxed text-gray-700\">Olimpiade Sains, Riset Ilmiah</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2.5 align-top leading-relaxed text-gray-700\">Fokus mutlak pada capaian medali OSN/Internasional yang selaras dengan fakultas FMIPA/FT.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n</div>",
